00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:38.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Google reps try to confuse with things, so there's 3 types. So there's… I think of it like Goldilocks and the Three Bears, you know, there's, like, too much, just right, and then too cold, or whatever. There's exact match, which is, like, they have to search this character for character, word for word, or your ad doesn't show up. That's too extreme.

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:43.000
Carmen Cruickshank: There's also broad match where wedding venues Kokomo would show up.

