Carmen Cruickshank: I don't know, Kokomo sounds Caribbean, right? So maybe it's, like, Caribbean islands, and it would just show up for something completely out there, right? And then phrase match, Google understands the meaning of this keyword, so they show it for people searching around that. So phrase match is what you want.

